  "body": "Currently [`RenderingContext`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#renderingcontext) is specced as\r\n\r\n```webidl\r\n    typedef (CanvasRenderingContext2D or ImageBitmapRenderingContext or WebGLRenderingContext or WebGL2RenderingContext) RenderingContext;\r\n```\r\n\r\nwhich is a bit of a mouthful and harder for specs to extend (the webxr spec wishes to add an XRPresentationContext)\r\n\r\nInstead, we should probably make it a empty abstract interface and have other interfaces extend from it. This would involve updating the webgl specs as well, however.\r\n\r\n(It may be worth writing the spec for `getContext()` explicitly in a way that allows for extension by other specs)\r\n\r\ncc @toji ",
